  "rationale": "`assets/skills/habeas/SKILL.md` is a bundled skill. It has front matter and a `# Habeas` heading, so it is a site of `requirements.cli.skill_conventions.workflow`.\n\nIt meets the obligation:\n- The `# Habeas` heading has only a short introductory paragraph before its first subsection. That paragraph is not a separate section.\n- The first subsection is `section[Habeas]/section[Workflow]`, which comes before `Testing and coverage artifacts`, `Inspecting`, `Requirements, examples, and definitions`, `References` and `Gotchas`.\n- The Workflow section is an ordered list of numbered steps: `- [ ] 1. Pick the skill for the task` and `- [ ] 2. Follow that skill; each one names the next`.\n\nNo violation matches were listed for this site. I found no gap.",
